  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spreading Joys - Biporjoy Cyclone Affected</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is no Joy in Biporjoy Cycolne. The Biporjoy cyclone was very devastating and affected people in Gujarat; mainly in Saurashtra and Kutch regions on 15th June 2023. This severe cyclonic storm with a maximum sustained wind speed of 125-135 kmph. Many poor people lost their Kacchha houses in this cyclone. The poor people and people with disabilities have lost their livelihood means, BPA has intiaiated relief work in affected areas by providing Ration kits, assistive devices, and livelihood.</narrative>
  </description>
